  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.7 - Type-Specific Component Tags (January 2026)\n- NEW: Type-Specific Tags - Element, Block, Data, Nav with auto path prefix\n- NEW: OnAfterIncludeRender callback - fires after component renders for wrapping\n- NEW: ComponentType property in IncludeInfo - identify component type\n- All Include features work with type-specific tags\n\nv1.0.6 - OnBeforeIncludeRender Event\n- OnBeforeIncludeRender callback - fires before each Include renders\n- Enables dynamic data loading per component (cache fetch, DB query)\n- Param default attribute + Folder-based components\n\nv1.0.5 - Pre-Render Data Extraction\n- ExtractIncludeNames() - Get cache keys before rendering\n- PrepareTemplate() + RenderPrepared() for maximum efficiency\n\nv1.0.4 - Auto Cache Invalidation\nv1.0.3 - Dynamic Param Values\nv1.0.0 - Initial Release",
